 acceptance and payment on 2 December 2026."],"risks_en":["The rights issue of up to 1,779,246,481 new shares at RM0.20 each may dilute existing shareholders' equity.","The company reported a net loss of RM94.49 million for the quarter ended 30 June 2026, with net margin at -56.2%, widening from -51.8% in the previous quarter."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 30 June 2026, revenue was RM168.01 million, up 15.2% QoQ but down 16.6% YoY; net loss was RM94.49 million with a net margin of -56.2%, widening from -51.8% in the previous quarter."}